abstract: >-
  An analytical book examining the structural correspondence between
  Elon Musk's public technological vision and Charles Stross's 2005
  novel Accelerando across 12 independently scored concept pairs.
  Triangulates three intellectual positions: Stross as novelist (2005),
  Musk as builder, and Stross as polemicist (2022 to 2026). The book
  treats Musk as an honest actor and leaves genuinely open whether his
  trajectory is good or bad for humanity.
